<title>JAPAN: Yamaichi Sec says to close three European offices.</title>
<headline>Yamaichi Sec says to close three European offices.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yamaichi Securities Co Ltd said on Monday that it would close three of its European offices and make London the centre of its European operations.</p>
<p>An Italian subsidiary and two representative offices in Berlin and Madrid will be shut down in the current business year ending March 31, which will result in a reduction in the number of offices in Europe to five, a Yamaichi executive said.</p>
<p>He said the moves were part of the company's plan to streamline its operations in Europe.</p>
</text>
